The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository that we wrote. It does
NOT cover the released model weights, the vendored third-party code, or the data
and models this project depends on. Those terms are:

  GRAFT model weights (ympradyumna/graft on the Hugging Face Hub)
      Released for non-commercial research use only.

  third_party/mapanything/   Apache License 2.0, (c) Meta Platforms, Inc.
      Full text in third_party/mapanything/LICENSE. Modifications are recorded
      in third_party/PATCHES.md and third_party/local-changes.patch.

  third_party/omnieraser/    Under the OmniEraser project's own terms.

Dependencies fetched at run time or downloaded by the user, each under its own
licence and NOT redistributed here:

  MapAnything weights (facebook/map-anything)   CC BY-NC 4.0 — non-commercial
  SMPL-X body models                            non-commercial research licence
  NLF detector weights                          non-commercial research use
  MoGe, WiLoR, OmniEraser weights               see their respective projects
  PROX and RICH datasets                        distributed by their own authors

Because the pipeline loads CC BY-NC 4.0 and research-licensed models at run time,
running GRAFT as released is non-commercial research use in practice, whatever the
licence on our own source files permits in isolation.
